{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your breed and build your clan. An open-world adventure about a pup from the Scottish highlands destined to lead a rebellion against the evil Cat King Of England.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the beautiful open world of the Paw Isles, rescuing and gaining control of a variety of different dog breeds, from the Schnauzers in Shnuazerland, to the Pugs in Pugton. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bark to convince rogue dogs to join your rebellion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name and upgrade your clan of pups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain new abilities to traverse a gorgeous open world reminiscent of Wind Waker and Breath of the Wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to beautiful Scottish music as you lead your pack of pups.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1952020?t=1755267010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755267010","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952020/6934c9ecb45b58e64fb15449afede88a20f0bd99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755267010","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1952020/6934c9ecb45b58e64fb15449afede88a20f0bd99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755267010","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3385480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your breed and build your clan. An open-world adventure about a pup from the Scottish highlands destined to lead a rebellion against the evil Cat King Of England.  </p><p class=\"bb